# Audio

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M2 Vertical slice
Dependencies: `05_ELEMENT_REACTIONS.todo`, `06_MATCH_FLOW_SCORING.todo`

## Purpose

Use original audio to communicate element identity, contact, reactions, pressure, and match outcome.

## Tasks

- [ ] Define audio direction.
- [ ] Create Ice and Fire spray loops.
- [ ] Create territory impact sounds.
- [ ] Create Mist reaction stinger.
- [ ] Create movement-on-territory sounds.
- [ ] Create status-effect sounds.
- [ ] Create pressure warning.
- [ ] Create UI confirmation/cancel sounds.
- [ ] Create result stingers.
- [ ] Implement mixer groups and volume settings.
- [ ] Implement click-free spray loop transitions.
- [ ] Validate simultaneous-effect limits.
- [ ] Record source and licenses.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Players can identify active element and reaction through audio support.
- [ ] Spray audio starts and stops responsively.
- [ ] Important warnings remain audible in a busy mix.
- [ ] Master, music, SFX, and UI volume are configurable.
- [ ] All audio is original or properly licensed.

